From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: LineageOS Developer <developer@lineageos.org>
Date: Fri, 29 May 2026 22:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Add Spreadtrum IMS old AIDL protocol reference

Documentation file describing the old Android 9 era IImsServiceController
AIDL protocol used by the Spreadtrum IMS APK. The actual protocol
translation is handled in SprdImsServiceControllerCompat.java via raw
Parcel transactions.

Change-Id: I0000000000000000000000000000000000000001
---
 .../ISprdImsServiceController.aidl.txt          | 15 +++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 15 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 telephony/java/com/android/ims/internal/ISprdImsServiceController.aidl.txt

diff --git a/telephony/java/com/android/ims/internal/ISprdImsServiceController.aidl.txt b/telephony/java/com/android/ims/internal/ISprdImsServiceController.aidl.txt
new file mode 100644
index 000000000000..39e03eea3c45
--- /dev/null
+++ b/telephony/java/com/android/ims/internal/ISprdImsServiceController.aidl.txt
@@ -0,0 +1,15 @@
+// Intentionally empty - the old Spreadtrum AIDL protocol is handled via
+// raw Parcel transactions in SprdImsServiceControllerCompat.java.
+// This file exists only to document the old AIDL layout:
+//
+// Old IImsServiceController (Android 9, android.telephony.ims.aidl):
+//   setListener(IBinder)
+//   createMmTelFeature(int, IImsFeatureStatusCallback) -> IImsMMTelFeature
+//   createRcsFeature(int, IImsFeatureStatusCallback) -> IImsRcsFeature
+//   querySupportedImsFeatures() -> ImsFeatureConfiguration
+//   notifyImsServiceReadyForFeatureCreation()
+//   removeImsFeature(int, int, IImsFeatureStatusCallback)
+//   getConfig(int) -> IImsConfig
+//   getRegistration(int) -> IImsRegistration
+//   enableIms(int)
+//   disableIms(int)
